{"id":"7a632dcea280a149","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pcp.md","title":"df-pcp (Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class)","display":"df-pcp (Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"display":"df-pcp (Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class)","label":"28-df-pcp","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-pcp","PCP","Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.4; Remark 11.6","source_printed_pages":"241–242","source_pdf_pages":"267–268","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pcp (Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pcp"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pcp</span><span>PCP</span><span>Probabilistically Checkable Proof Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.4; Remark 11.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"241–242"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"267–268"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r,q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，其中本地固定随机带接口的资源参数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>限于下式定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li>验证者候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(R,Q,A)\">\\(V=(R,Q,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,A\">\\(Q,A\\)</span> 为采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 固定元数编码的确定型多项式时间函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\">\\(Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\)</span> 输出有限正整数地址序列的规范编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x,\\rho,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(A(x,\\rho,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，邻接字串表示连接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PosSeq}=(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{PosSeq}=(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EncSeq}\">\\(\\operatorname{EncSeq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DecSeq}\">\\(\\operatorname{DecSeq}\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\">\\(|s|\\)</span> 对序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 表示元素数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}\">\\(s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\)</span>；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat Q\">\\(\\widehat Q\\)</span> 及地址投影仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\">\\(Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\)</span> 时定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\Sigma\">\\(\\pi:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\Sigma\\)</span> 为固定只读证明；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}\\)</span>；地址和答案均采用规范二进制编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)\\coloneqq1^{|s|}0\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{EncSeq}:\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)\\coloneqq1^{|s|}0\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{EncSeq}:\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{EncSeq}),\\qquad\\operatorname{DecSeq}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\;\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{EncSeq}),\\qquad\\operatorname{DecSeq}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\;\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\\coloneqq\\{R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ f(1^n)=1^{R(n)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R\\coloneqq\\{R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ f(1^n)=1^{R(n)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DecSeq}(Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))),\\qquad q_V(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq|\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)|,\\qquad j_i(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_V(x,\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DecSeq}(Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))),\\qquad q_V(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq|\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)|,\\qquad j_i(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_V(x,\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi(j_1(x,\\rho)),\\ldots,\\pi(j_{q_V(x,\\rho)}(x,\\rho))\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi(j_1(x,\\rho)),\\ldots,\\pi(j_{q_V(x,\\rho)}(x,\\rho))\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-R(|x|)}\\sum_{\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}}A(x,\\rho,z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-R(|x|)}\\sum_{\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}}A(x,\\rho,z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists V=(R,Q,A)\\ [&amp;R\\in\\mathcal R\\land Q,A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [R(|x|)\\le r(|x|)\\land\\forall\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}\\ [Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\land q_V(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q_V(x,\\rho)\\}\\ 1\\le j_i(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)2^{r(|x|)}]]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\le1/2]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists V=(R,Q,A)\\ [&amp;R\\in\\mathcal R\\land Q,A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [R(|x|)\\le r(|x|)\\land\\forall\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}\\ [Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\land q_V(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q_V(x,\\rho)\\}\\ 1\\le j_i(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)2^{r(|x|)}]]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\le1/2]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>按书 Definition 11.4，采用非适应查询、完整性一、可靠性二分之一；下标 r,q 是精确资源界，渐近常数由定理外层并集表达。地址显式限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\ldots,q(n)2^{r(n)}\">\\(1,\\ldots,q(n)2^{r(n)}\\)</span>，因此无限函数形式的证明只使用该有限前缀，与书中的有限证明等价；不依赖任意地址的隐式重编号算法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>R5 修订：随机位长度仅须在一元输入上一元输出可由多项式时间函数计算，不能限定为精确的自然系数多项式；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(R(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span> 是合法资源函数。旧限制会排除 PCP 定理所需的对数随机位，已移除。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对资源域的说明：本地固定长度随机带版本显式限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>，允许通过计算<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(n)\">\\(r(n)\\)</span>并补读无用随机位统一每个长度的随机带。本书实际使用的对数、多项式界均满足此条件；这里不声称处理任意不可计算或非有效的精细随机位界。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>旧版采用适应查询与 2/3 对 1/3，虽在 PCP 定理量级可转换，细粒度参数接口有差异；现统一到书中版本。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.4; Remark 11.6，印刷页 241–242；PDF 页 267–268。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$r,q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，其中本地固定随机带接口的资源参数$r$限于下式定义的$\\mathcal R$；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"验证者候选 $V=(R,Q,A)$，其中 $R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$Q,A$ 为采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 固定元数编码的确定型多项式时间函数；$Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))$ 输出有限正整数地址序列的规范编码，$A(x,\\rho,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r,q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"V=(R,Q,A)","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Q,A","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))","display":false},{"tex":"A(x,\\rho,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PosSeq}=(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1})^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EncSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DecSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"|s|","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j),\\qquad \\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(\\langle j\\rangle^\\frown s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(j)\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)\\coloneqq1^{|s|}0\\operatorname{blk}_{\\mathrm{PCP}}(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{EncSeq}:\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{EncSeq}),\\qquad\\operatorname{DecSeq}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\operatorname{PosSeq}\\;\\operatorname{EncSeq}(s)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R\\coloneqq\\{R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ f(1^n)=1^{R(n)}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DecSeq}(Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))),\\qquad q_V(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq|\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)|,\\qquad j_i(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\widehat Q(x,\\rho)_i\\quad(1\\le i\\le q_V(x,\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)\\coloneqq\\langle\\pi(j_1(x,\\rho)),\\ldots,\\pi(j_{q_V(x,\\rho)}(x,\\rho))\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-R(|x|)}\\sum_{\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}}A(x,\\rho,z_{V,\\pi}(x,\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists V=(R,Q,A)\\ [&R\\in\\mathcal R\\land Q,A\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [R(|x|)\\le r(|x|)\\land\\forall\\rho\\in\\Sigma^{R(|x|)}\\ [Q(\\operatorname{tup}_2(x,\\rho))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{DecSeq})\\land q_V(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,q_V(x,\\rho)\\}\\ 1\\le j_i(x,\\rho)\\le q(|x|)2^{r(|x|)}]]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)=1\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\pi\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{V,\\pi}(x)\\le1/2]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1,\\ldots,q(n)2^{r(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"R(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"r(n)","display":false}],"bytes":4834,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"PCP：[[28-df-pcp]]、[[28-thm-pcp]]、[[28-df-gap-problem]]、[[28-df-max-3sat]]、[[28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness]]。"},{"id":"9e7559e5bc3868e1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\mathbf{PCP}[r,q]$ 采用 [[28-df-pcp]] 的非适应查询、完整性一、可靠性二分之一约定。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}